  "prefLabel": "Cul-H 201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cul-H 201.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide a uniform procedure for the conduct of public hearings at which comment from the general public will be solicited for evaluation and consideration by the commissioner relative to rulemaking.\n\nSource. #10218, eff 10-30-12, EXPIRED: 7-1-18",
